  "claim": "borg_defend_aux_tele_away() (borg-fight-defend.c:1155-1159 and 1272-1273 at e473720ed) accepted and used the Teleport Other spell, the tele_other activation and a charged Wand of Teleport Other, but not the Rod of Teleport Other (sv_rod_teleport_other is looked up in borg-item-val.c:417 and used only by the shopping code). A Borg without the spell that carried only the rod never chose this defence: a wounded Warrior next to a hill giant queued melee instead. The correction accepts the rod through borg_equips_rod() (charged, and the Borg's own device-skill check) and zaps it with borg_zap_rod() after the spell, activation and wand; the '5' target key that follows is unchanged. The wand control (both changed lines run) and a harmless-monster control are byte-identical.",
